        "role": "close",
        "subject": "The tan street_dog, about a quarter of the frame height, seen from behind and to its left on a broom finished walk in a warm pool, head turned toward a crossover far down the dark street whose body and two red tail lamps show at the right. A chain link fence recedes on the left and straw grass sits on the right.",
        "visual_consequence": "Without the headline it reads as the dog still on its street watching the survey car leave in the dark. The hook gives the line to the director whose quote the dek carries. Bold: the darkest sky of the three and one lit subject in a pool.",
